				<pubDate>Mon, 07 Dec 2020 01:03:28 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:50;"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/a/wlMmiUN" style="width:50;" alt="wlMmiUN" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:50;"> <p>SCP-5188 being observed by cameras</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5188</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> KETER OH GOSH RUN</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5188's cell door must be chained by 10 heavy padlocks, have a 5 digit access code, a level 4 card reader, and voice and oral recognition. NOBODY is allowed into SCP-5188's cage <strong><em><span style="text-decoration: underline;">UNDER ANY CIRCUMSTANCES</span></em></strong> (See incident 5188-A-1).</p> <p>All level 2 and below must stay 100 feet away from SCP-5188. There must be 5 heavily armed guards, with direct access to the MTF and RRT.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5188 is a standard amazon box, with no anomalous effects. SCP-5188's anomalous affects only trigger when touched. When touched, SCP-5188 will suddenly sprout human arms and legs, through the bottom. It looks like a mother████ing cardboard spider. SCP-5188 will then undergo a rage state, where it will kill everything in its path by [DATA EXPUNGED] them.</p> <p>Exactly 69 seconds (1 minute and 9 seconds) after a human is killed, more &quot;cardboard spiders&quot; drag them away. They then appear again, with their face taped to the cardboard box. These spiders manifest only when SCP-5188 kills someone, therefore they are dubbed SCP-5188-1, and are to be treated as such.</p> <p><strong>INCIDENT-5188-A-1:</strong></p> <div class="blockquote"> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> D-████, please approach SCP-5188.</p> <p><em>D-████ approaches the box, and stands in front of it</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> Please touch it.</p> <p><strong>D-████:</strong> Y'know, that doesnt seem like a good idea.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> I said please touch SCP-5188. We talked about not following rules earlier. This is why you are here. Now touch SCP-5188</p> <p><em>D-████ touches SCP-5188</em></p> <p><strong>D-████:</strong> Hey that wasnt so ba-</p> <p>[DATA EXPUNGED]</p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> That was horrifying. Well now to write down the results.</p> <p><em>The carboard spider crawls around, then jumps on the viewing glass</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> THE ████? Is this normal? Ill write this down.</p> <p><em>Dr. ███ writes something down. The carboard spider following him on the glass</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> Hey wait, whats that? Move it ████ spider.</p> <p><em>Dr. ███ promptly hits the glass, and the cardboard spider falls off. He then sees something coming out of the shadows</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> Hey! What the heck? I only remember putting in 1 test subject! Wait, thats not a human&#8230;</p> <p><em>It crawls out and appears to be a manifestation of SCP-5188 (SCP-5188-1)</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> Another one? This isnt good. This is very bad oh nonono I have to get out.</p> <p><em>Dr. ███ is starting to exit the viewing room, when he pauses</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> What? Its taking his body? Hm&#8230;</p> <p><em>5 seconds pass</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. ███:</strong> OH ████ ITS WEARING HIS FACE AND ITS ████ING SMILING AT ME! ITS ████ING SMILING! WHAT THE F-</p> <p><em>SCP-5188 jumps through the glass and tackles Dr. ███. It then proceeds to</em></p> <p>[DATA EXPUNGED]</p> <p>[REDACTED]</p> <p>[REDACTED]</p> <p><em>Now nothing is left in the cell, except for a lot of blood, and a empty cardboard box</em></p> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5187">SCP-5187</a> | SCP-5188 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5189">SCP-5189</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7059423&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607309826" alt="Duccy boi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7059423)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/duccy-boi" >Duccy boi</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
