&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;« &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-10-2020&quot;&gt;October 2020&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-11-2020&quot;&gt;November 2020&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; | &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/news-12-2020&quot;&gt;December 2020&lt;/a&gt; »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:75%;&quot;&gt;This is a series showing off news from the site, articles from the past month&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-121404-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, and fan-content for you to check out and discover! Be sure to leave a comment with your thoughts!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;Fandom Stuff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
