scp-wiki.net/scp-096</a> - DrDan</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Recording Name</th> <th>Description</th> <th>Links</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Episode 3: &quot;This Bird Is Gonna Eat The Whole World&#8230;&quot;</td> <td>Crosstesting madness! In this episode, Tanhony and Darnell check out some clockworks, a weird pen, the O5 Council's highest priority and one robot dude&#8230;</td> <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wnACn9T4Ww8">Youtube</a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/7ksNKB4zGp4Yntlq9YlrRM">Spotify</a></td> </tr> </table> <p><strong>Files Read:</strong></p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-914</a> - far2<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-067">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-067</a> - FritzWillie<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-085">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-085</a> - FritzWillie<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-846">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-846</a> - Tanhony</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <table class="wiki-content-table"> <tr> <th>Recording Name</th> <th>Description</th> <th>Links</th> </tr> <tr> <td>Episode 4: &quot;YOU DID WHAT&quot;</td> <td>In this episode, Tanhony and Darnell collect some neat toys and become Mr. Podcast! Also, they read a neat book about the stars.</td> <td><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lJP7NgO6J3I">Youtube</a>, <a href="https://open.spotify.com/episode/0CE1FdW0wnvIbqt0H2yiyv">Spotify</a></td> </tr> </table> <p><strong>Files Read:</strong></p> <p><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-909">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-909</a> - Salman Corbette<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-905">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-905</a> - Salman Corbette<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-917">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-917</a> - Dexanote<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-920">http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-920</a> - Salman Corbette<br /> <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-527">http://www.scp-wiki.