&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6394686&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607309832&quot; alt=&quot;forbiddenquest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6394686)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/forbiddenquest&quot;  &gt;forbiddenquest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#039;s drawing of me inspired by my nonstop talking about MGS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
