ocal--resized-images/grigori-karpin-s-author-page/5079A/medium.jpg" style="width:70%;" alt="5079A" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:70%;"> <p>IAmReal's art inspired by SCP-5079.</p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>If you want to see more from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5886073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607309832" alt="IAmReal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5886073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/iamreal" >IAmReal</a></span>, check out their tumblr page: <a href="https://iamreal44.tumblr.com/">IAmReal's tumblr</a></em> <hr /> <blockquote> <p>Check out forbiddenquest's <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/forbiddenquest">author page</a></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span><strong>TRANSLATIONS</strong>:</span></h4> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Open</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">So&nbsp;Flattered&nbsp;by&nbsp;These!</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Japanese Branch Wiki</em><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em><br /> <a href="http://lafundacionscp.wikidot.com/scp-4612">SCP-4612</a> - <em>On the Spanish Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-4712">SCP-4712</a> - <em>On the Japanese Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5079">SCP-5079</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5612">SCP-5612</a> - <em>On the Chinese Branch Wiki</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">INFOGRAPHICS</span></strong>:</span></h4> </div> <br /> I've started to craft infographics that represent a simple lecture into the SCP Foundation in and out of universe. <p>If you'd like to take a look:<br /> <a href="https://imgur.com/a/Kv0wfOZ">Grig's SCP-Wiki 101</a></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">List of Articles created</span></strong>:</span></h2> <h3><span><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Co-authored by me</span></strong>:</span></h3> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-737313-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. They connect and should be read in order, if you want the maximum experience&#8230; although you could read them separately as well.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-737313-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. This was my first attempt at writing an article, its still my most successful to date.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-737313-3"><a href="javascript:;" >3</a>. Technically not really part of the series, but following the antics of Dr. Varga and Agent Douglas after SCP-4612, and the events here become important later.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-737313-4"><a href="javascript:;" >4</a>. I have probably never written anything more personal.</div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Ignore&nbsp;this</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Leave&nbsp;me&nbsp;Alone</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>(Wanting to catch up on S&amp;C Plastics, so I put this here for my own reference)</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">►&nbsp;For&nbsp;research&nbsp;-&nbsp;Ignore&nbsp;this&nbsp;◄</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Shhhhhhhh</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> Bones<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> Me<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 3.0<br /> <strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Paris Catacombs</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> 5079<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wik